## Overview
This repository contains the Java implementation for Practical 1. It demonstrates the behavior of three classical software mutual exclusion algorithms using two concurrent threads simulating a shared memory environment.

## How to Run
1. Navigate to the `src` directory:
   ```bash
   cd src
   javac *.java
   java Main